---
import { alphaFinding } from '../data/findings';
---
<figure class="finding-chart">
  <figcaption>Directional edge versus each asset's direction-matched base rate · percentage points</figcaption>
  <ul aria-label="Measured directional edge by asset">
    {alphaFinding.assets.map((asset) => (
      <li>
        <span class="symbol">{asset.symbol}</span>
        <span class="track" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="bar" style={`left: ${asset.edge < 0 ? 50 + asset.edge * 18 : 50}%; width: ${Math.abs(asset.edge) * 18}%`} />
        </span>
        <span class="result">{asset.edge > 0 ? '+' : ''}{asset.edge.toFixed(1)} pp</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
  <p>Reported in the <a href={alphaFinding.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener">July 2026 findings ↗</a>. The spread is noise around zero; it does not establish an edge.</p>
</figure>
<style>
  .finding-chart { min-width: 0; }
  figcaption { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--text-3); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  ul { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 52px minmax(0,1fr) 72px; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .symbol, .result { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .result { text-align: right; }
  .track { position: relative; height: 10px; background: var(--surface-2); }
  .track::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -4px; bottom: -4px; width: 1px; background: var(--text-3); }
  .bar { position: absolute; top: 1px; height: 8px; background: var(--accent); }
  p { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--text-3); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
  a { color: var(--text-1); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
